# CVE-2026-35515 — @nestjs/core Server-Sent Events (SSE) injection.
# Accepted: Kerghan's backend has no @Sse() routes/EventSource endpoints
# anywhere in backend/src (grep for `Sse` finds none), so this CVE's attack
# surface doesn't apply. 10.4.22 is already the latest patch on the 10.x
# line (confirmed via `npm view @nestjs/core versions` — no newer 10.x
# patch exists); a fix requires the 11.x major, which is a coordinated
# upgrade across every @nestjs/* package, out of scope for issue #24.
# Revisit once the tracked-repo/label-rule modules (or any future SSE use)
# land, or when a 10.x backport becomes available.
